        "The warband may include a single Warrior-Priest.",
        "The warband may include up to three Witch Hunters.",
        "The warband may include any number of Zealots.",
        "The warband may include up to five Flagellants.",
        "The warband may include up to five Warhounds.",
        "Zealots use the Zealot Equipment List; Flagellants use the Flagellant Equipment List (close combat weapons only - no missile weapons or armour).",
        "All other listed Witch Hunter fighters use the Witch Hunter Equipment List.",
        "Skill-category access (which of Combat/Shooting/Academic/Strength/Speed each Hero can pick from) could not be read from the source PDF's table for this warband - set here to mirror the closest equivalent Reikland Hero (Captain gets all five; the Witch Hunter mirrors a Champion; the Warrior-Priest is a best-effort judgement call favouring Academic/Combat) - verify against the printed skill table before relying on it for a competitive game."
